config VIRTIO_GPU_NV
    bool "Virtio NVIDIA GPU proxy driver"
    depends on VIRTIO
    default y
    help
        Provides /dev/nvidia* device files inside the VM that forward ioctls to the host's NVIDIA driver via a virtio control queue.
        Memory mappings are exposed via KVM memory slots so GPU command submission runs at native speed without any VMM involvement.
        Required for CUDA, Vulkan, NVENC, and NVDEC inside a libkrun VM.If unsure, say N.
